<title>SPAIN: Spain July PPI fell 0.2 pct, yr-yr 0.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain July PPI fell 0.2 pct, yr-yr 0.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		     July 96     June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Pct change on month		  -0.2	  -0.2	 0.1</p>
<p> Pct change on year		    0.9	   1.2	 6.9</p>
<p>The INE gave the following breakdown (percentage change)</p>
<p>					   JULY 96    JUNE 96   JULY 96/95</p>
<p> Energy				   -0.2	-0.8	  2.0</p>
<p> Non-energy minerals, chemicals   -1.0	-0.3	 -3.9</p>
<p> Metals, precision tools	     0.1	 0.3	  2.8</p>
<p> Other manufacturing		  -0.1	-0.2	  1.7</p>
<p> Consumer goods			  0.0	 0.1	  3.9</p>
<p> Capital goods			   0.2	-0.1	  2.4</p>
<p> Intermediary goods		   -0.4	-0.3	 -2.1</p>
</text>
